        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "Many cis women post-hysterectomy also experience menstrual symptoms, yet no one ever bothered to investigate their claims due to medical misogyny. Given the medical establishment’s very recent admission of their ignorance on the complexity of pmos (pcos) and the absolute dearth of research on trans women, it is rather unsurprising that people are straight up calling us hysterical for sharing our bodily experiences that challenge their narrow preconception of the female body. Trans women truly are the women of women."
        },
